WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.350
 Some would say that we're in
a post-feminist era because they

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:05.355
hope it will go away.

00:00:05.355 --> 00:00:07.089
[LAUGHS]

00:00:07.089 --> 00:00:09.930
[CHEERS AND APPLAUSE]

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:12.090
We are the revolution
that is going

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:14.550
to see to it that
no one is ever born

00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:17.940
into an inferior role again
because of race or of sex.

00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:22.260
The feminist is someone who
believes in the full humanity

00:00:22.260 --> 00:00:23.400
of all people.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:26.240
That's it.

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:28.310
 Every single
individual on the planet

00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:30.800
deserves the same
sovereignty over their being.

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
And when you see that,
it changes your worldview

00:00:33.470 --> 00:00:35.820
on everything.

00:00:35.820 --> 00:00:37.280
 There's a long
history of people

00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:38.960
taking their painful
living truths

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:42.650
and channeling
that into justice.

00:00:42.650 --> 00:00:45.890
 So we've never had an
attitude, a cultural response

00:00:45.890 --> 00:00:49.160
here in the United States, that
said, caregiving is actually

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:52.470
in the public interest.

00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:55.920
 To watch this class, you
don't need to be a woman.

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:58.140
You don't have to
be an activist.

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:00.750
Feminism is open for
everyone, and it's

00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:04.485
a way of challenging a
division that should not exist.

00:01:04.485 --> 00:01:07.790
[CROWD CHANTING]

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:10.040
 Justice is different
for different people.

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:14.540
In some states, survivors are
charged for their rape kits.

00:01:14.540 --> 00:01:16.730
 It's such a
painful waste of time

00:01:16.730 --> 00:01:18.650
to fight so hard
to be ourselves.

00:01:18.650 --> 00:01:20.700
 The change comes
from the bottom up.

00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:23.877
It's the whole nature of
even democracy itself.

00:01:23.877 --> 00:01:26.210
 Whether you're talking about
abortion rights, violence

00:01:26.210 --> 00:01:30.560
against women, or caregiving,
all leads you to that place.

00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:33.170
What is the world we
really want to have?

00:01:33.170 --> 00:01:34.250
 I'm Amanda Nguyen.

00:01:34.250 --> 00:01:35.240
 I'm Tina Tchen.

00:01:35.240 --> 00:01:36.680
 I'm adrienne maree brown.

00:01:36.680 --> 00:01:37.880
 I'm Gloria Steinem.

00:01:37.880 --> 00:01:39.950
ALL: And this is MasterClass.

